{"product_id":"juicy-apples-i-love-salts","title":"Juicy Apples by I Love Salts","description":"\u003cp\u003eJuicy Apples Nic Salt e-Liquid is a slice of fresh, invigorating sweetness that comes to you via I Love Salts, the newest juice like from Mad Hatter Vapes. This mouthwatering e-liquid is infused with pure apple goodness that’s as crisp and sweet as taking a big bite of an apple plucked right from the tree! As you inhale, you can taste the essence of sliced apple or apple juice, which heightens at the top of the inhale. The exhale leaves a pleasantly sweet aftertaste too.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJuicy Apples is available in 25 mg or 50 mg nicotine levels to give you that extra oomph you need sometimes. This juice is made with 50% VG and 50% PG, so balances flavor and vapor well, but still gives a noticeable throat hit. Like other nicotine salt vape liquids, Juicy Apples is only intended for use in pod systems.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDig into a bottle of Juicy Apples by I Love Salts today!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWanna try more flavours? Choose your favourite \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003ca title=\"I love salts\" href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/i-love-salts-e-juice\"\u003eI Love Salts\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cspan\u003e from our collection. Else, shop from our \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003ca title=\"e liquid online Kenya\" href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nic-salts\"\u003ee liquid online Kenya\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cspan\u003e collection with more than +150 salts option.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","brand":"I LOVE SALTS","offers":[{"title":"5.0% (50mg)","offer_id":41670485704759,"sku":"Juicy Apples by I Love S - 50 mg","price":999.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"2.5% (25mg)","offer_id":41670485737527,"sku":"Juicy Apples by I Love S - 25 mg","price":999.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thu